        <h1>About DomoMaker</h1>

        <p>
            DomoMaker is a website where users can create and own Domos.
        </p>

        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>
            Users can create an account, log in, and make Domos by choosing a name, age, and color. 

            Each Domo is saved to the user's account so they can view their collection whenever they log in.
        </p>

        <h2>What is Domo?</h2>
        <p>
            Domo is a little monster which is the mascot for the Japanese television channel, NHK.
        </p>
